    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 56025645309964
    m_Localized: Receive the review team and pass the final stability inspection.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 56025645309965
    m_Localized: Pass the stability program inspection.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 56025645309966
    m_Localized: Utility Calm
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 56025645309967
    m_Localized: Keep water recovery and oxygen online for a full sol.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 56025645309968
    m_Localized: Maintain 1 operational Water Reclamation unit for 1 sol.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 56025645309969
    m_Localized: Maintain 1 operational Oxygen Station for 1 sol.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 56025645309970
    m_Localized: Supply Transfer
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 56025645309971
    m_Localized: Reserve the package and wait for the next mission arrival.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 56025645309972
    m_Localized: Reserve 10 aluminium for shipment.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 56025645309973
    m_Localized: Wait for the next mission arrival.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 56025645309974
    m_Localized: Utility Norms
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 56025645309975
    m_Localized: Keep oxygen and water recovery online while the bureau runs its
      checklist.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 56025645309976
    m_Localized: Maintain 1 operational Oxygen Station for 1 sol.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 56025645309977
    m_Localized: Maintain 1 operational Water Reclamation unit for 1 sol.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 56025645309978
    m_Localized: European Audit
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 56025645309979
    m_Localized: Receive the inspection delegation and pass the final review.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 56025645309980
    m_Localized: Pass the European inspection.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 56025645309981
    m_Localized: Laboratory Shipment
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 56025649504256
    m_Localized: Reserve the sample and wait for the next mission to return.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 56025649504257
    m_Localized: Reserve 12 Rogalite for shipment.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 56025649504258
    m_Localized: Wait for the next mission arrival.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 56025649504259
    m_Localized: First Civic Visit
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 56025649504260
    m_Localized: Welcome the first visitors and pass the civic readiness inspection.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 56025649504261
    m_Localized: Pass the civic visit inspection.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 56025649504262
    m_Localized: Civil Utilities
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 56025649504263
    m_Localized: Support the new quarters with food and oxygen stability.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 56025649504264
    m_Localized: Build 1 Dinner Station.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 56025649504265
    m_Localized: Maintain 1 operational Oxygen Station for 1 sol.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 56025649504266
    m_Localized: Base Materials Shipment
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 56025649504267
    m_Localized: Reserve the aluminium and wait for the next mission arrival.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 56025649504268
    m_Localized: Reserve 14 aluminium for shipment.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 56025649504269
    m_Localized: Wait for the next mission arrival.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 56025649504270
    m_Localized: Base Celebration
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 56025649504271
    m_Localized: Receive the service review and pass the final event inspection.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 56025649504272
    m_Localized: Pass the celebration inspection.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 56025649504273
    m_Localized: Hosted Service
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 56025649504274
    m_Localized: Keep food and water support online while the service wing is reviewed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 56025649504275
    m_Localized: Build 1 Water Processing Unit.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 56025649504276
    m_Localized: Maintain 1 operational Dinner Station for 1 sol.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 56025649504277
    m_Localized: Fast Dispatch
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 56025649504278
    m_Localized: Reserve the regolith and wait for the next mission arrival.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 56025649504279
    m_Localized: Reserve 10 Rogalite for shipment.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 56025649504280
    m_Localized: Wait for the next mission arrival.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
